LAB PAR YEH THI LAILA KI FUGA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
 AB KAISE JIYE YEH TERI MAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
DIL ME TAMANNA THI BETA DEKHOGI KABHI TERA SEHRA,<br>
 METTI ME MERE ARMAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
SAR PA MERE GAR HOTI RIDA MAI TUJH KO KAFAN DETI BETA,<br>
 SHARMINDA HAI TUJH SE TERI MAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
QAIME JO LAYI LAASHE PISAR GHASH KHAKE GIRI US DAM MADAR,<br>
 KEHTI THI JIYO KAISE MAI YAHA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
ZAINAB KO YEH GHAM THA HAD SE SIWA THI KHOON ME DOOBI JIS KI RIDA,<br>
 SAR PEET KE WO KARTI THI FUGAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
TUM NE JO SADA DI BABA KO RUQSAT HUVI BEENAYI DEKHO,<br>
AANKAO MEIN THA CHAYA SHAH KE DHUVA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
LAASHA TERA DEKHI REYTI PAR AB KAISE SUKOO PAYE MADAR,<br>
 SAYE MEIN KABHI BAITHEY GI NA MAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
ZAINAB NE TUJHE KITNA CHAHA NAZAU SE MURADAO SE PAALA,<br>
 WO KAISE UTHAYE DAAG-E-JAWA HAYE MERE KAIDYAL JAWA<br>
<br>
EK KARB KA MANZAR THA WO TAQI ZAINAB PAQAYAMAT KI THI GHADI,<br>
 JAB KARTI THI MADAR ROKE FUGAA HAYE MERE KADIYAL JAWA